          "points": 0.25,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p><b>Question 2 (0.25 points)</b></p><p><b>Task 1 - Item 2 (0.25 mark):</b> Edit/replace the data of your resource. Copy the content of the <b>books.json</b> file. <i>(Given: database.json — 11 books; <code>GET http://localhost:9999/books</code>.)</i></p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p><b>Câu 2 (0.25 điểm)</b></p><p><b>Task 1 - Ý 2 (0.25 điểm):</b> Sửa/thay thế dữ liệu của tài nguyên. Sao chép nội dung file <b>books.json</b>. <i>(Given: database.json — 11 sách; <code>GET http://localhost:9999/books</code>.)</i></p></div>",
          "sampleSolution": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><pre><code>// database.json\n{\n  \"books\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"bookName\": \"CLEAN CODE\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/20/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 3,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"bookName\": \"DATA MINING\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/23/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 3,\n      \"bookName\": \"WEB SECURITY\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/26/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Security\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 4,\n      \"bookName\": \"REACT DESIGN PATTERNS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/29/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 5,\n      \"bookName\": \"MACHINE LEARNING BASICS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/32/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 6,\n      \"bookName\": \"NETWORK SECURITY ESSENTIALS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/35/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 3,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Security\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7,\n      \"bookName\": \"DESIGN OF EVERYDAY THINGS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/38/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 8,\n      \"bookName\": \"DEEP LEARNING\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/41/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 9,\n      \"bookName\": \"ETHICAL HACKING\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/44/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 3,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Security\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 10,\n      \"bookName\": \"PYTHON FOR DATA ANALYSIS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/47/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 11,\n      \"bookName\": \"UI UX FUNDAMENTALS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/50/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre><p>The books.json data (11 books). Traps built in: ids go past 10 (a string sort would put 10/11 before 2), and book 7 has status 2 but <code>isUnread: true</code> (appears in both Reading and UnRead lists). Check <code>GET http://localhost:9999/books</code>. Verified (Vite + React 18 + react-router-dom v6 + react-bootstrap + axios; Playwright 28/28 against json-server@0.17.4 serving the Given database.json).</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><pre><code>// database.json\n{\n  \"books\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"bookName\": \"CLEAN CODE\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/20/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 3,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"bookName\": \"DATA MINING\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/23/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 3,\n      \"bookName\": \"WEB SECURITY\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/26/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Security\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 4,\n      \"bookName\": \"REACT DESIGN PATTERNS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/29/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 5,\n      \"bookName\": \"MACHINE LEARNING BASICS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/32/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 6,\n      \"bookName\": \"NETWORK SECURITY ESSENTIALS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/35/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 3,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Security\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7,\n      \"bookName\": \"DESIGN OF EVERYDAY THINGS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/38/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 8,\n      \"bookName\": \"DEEP LEARNING\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/41/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 9,\n      \"bookName\": \"ETHICAL HACKING\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/44/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 3,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Security\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 10,\n      \"bookName\": \"PYTHON FOR DATA ANALYSIS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/47/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 1,\n      \"isUnread\": true,\n      \"bookType\": \"Data Science\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 11,\n      \"bookName\": \"UI UX FUNDAMENTALS\",\n      \"bookImage\": \"https://picsum.photos/id/50/300/400\",\n      \"bookReadingStatus\": 2,\n      \"isUnread\": false,\n      \"bookType\": \"Design\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</code></pre><p>Dữ liệu books.json (11 sách). Bẫy có sẵn: id vượt 10 (sắp kiểu chuỗi sẽ đặt 10/11 trước 2), và sách 7 có status 2 nhưng <code>isUnread: true</code> (hiện ở cả Reading lẫn UnRead). Kiểm bằng <code>GET http://localhost:9999/books</code>. Đã kiểm (Vite + React 18 + react-router-dom v6 + react-bootstrap + axios; Playwright 28/28 với json-server@0.17.4 chạy database.json của Given).</p></div>",
